              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka wa kelĩ wa kũsumbĩka kwa mũsumbĩ Ndalio, mwei wa thanthatũ, mũthenya wa mbee wa mwei, ndeto ya Yeova yamũkĩa Nzeluvaveli mwana wa Sealitieli, ngavana wa Yuta, na Yosua mwana wa Yeosataki, mũthembi mũnene, na kanyw’a mwathani Akai, ĩkĩmea, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
