              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩvo ĩndĩ Nzeluvaveli mwana wa Sealitieli, na Yosua mwana wa Yeosataki, mũthembi mũnene, vamwe na ũtialo w’onthe wa andũ, meewie wasya wa Yeova Ngai woo, na ndeto sya mwathani Akai, o tondũ Yeova Ngai woo wamũtũmĩte; na andũ meew’a w’ĩa vala ve Yeova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩvo ĩndĩ Akai, mũtũmwa wa Yeova, waneenie ũtũme wa Yeova kwa andũ, akĩmea, Nĩ vamwe nenyu, easya ũu Yeova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
